---
source: crates/tds_cli/tests/ui.rs
description: "struct Player:\n    name: String\n\nfn save(player: take Player):\n    print(player.name)\n\nfn main():\n    let player = Player(name: \"Alex\")\n    save(player)\n"
---
error[TDS0404]: `save` takes ownership of this argument
  ┌─ TDS0404-missing-take-marker.tds:9:10
  │
9 │     save(player)
  │          ^^^^^^ needs `take`
  │
  = note: parameter `player` is declared `take`, so the value moves into `save`
  = help: write `take player` to move it
  = help: or `take player.clone()` to move a copy and keep the original
